# A token copy of Aerid Konstrari (Three Steps Ahead, {U} and the {3} mode) is legendary too, so the legend rule makes
# Bot1 keep one (CR 704.5j). Bot1 keeps the original and the token is put into the graveyard: a token that dies (CR 700.4)
# still triggers its "dies" ability, looked back on as it was on the battlefield (CR 603.10a, 111.7: it ceases to exist
# afterwards). Heartwoods: the original's enters, the token's enters, and the token's death - three - and nothing
# of Aerid Konstrari's goes to the graveyard (a token is not a card).

